  _description: "A CLASSIC PUZZLE GAME LOVED BY MILLIONS\r\n\r\nA mysterious package
    arrives\u2026 and inside is Om Nom, a little monster with a big love for candy.\r\nYour
    task is simple: cut the ropes and get the candy to Om Nom.\r\n\r\nBut don\u2019t
    be fooled. Each level is a carefully crafted physics-based puzzle that challenges
    your logic, timing, and creativity."
